17rico.pdf"}], "name": "Rico: A Mobile App Dataset for Building Data-Driven Design Applications", "notes": "The annotation was reviewed against retained primary publication sources. Experiments have not been independently reproduced. The paper is a distinct resource from the already cataloged Rico dataset (url:0b134b082a7bd507fc6a). The publisher PDF describes 9.7k apps and 72k screens; the project page describes 9.3k apps and 66k screens. The annotation intentionally supplies no merged size claim.", "published_at": "2017-10-20", "relations": [], "review_status": "curated", "scope": "core", "summary": "Introduces Rico, collecting Android interface designs and interaction traces through crowdsourced use followed by automated exploration. The paper demonstrates UI-layout retrieval using learned representations and describes visual, textual, structural, and interaction data.", "topics": ["data-generation", "screen-understanding", "ui-design"], "updated_at": null, "url": "https://doi.org/10.1145/3126594.3126651"}
